  "body": [
    "Keep summer going on the court - Register for our Summer B session! - Register Now",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 American Collegiate Player Wildcard Playoffs",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
